WEBVTT

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.400
Luca…

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:13.730
Luca…

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.030
Come over here.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.830
You promised.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.960
I know nothing about that.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:30.660
That you will protect the 
spirit world of Duel Monsters!

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.370
I never made that promise!

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.200
Don't, Sunlight Unicorn!

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.760
How dare you.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:26.430
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:31.430
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:39.950
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:45.950
Break through even further

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:51.530
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:58.580
There's always only one truth

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.420
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:07.280
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:13.300
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:48.250
The Contaminated Spirit WorldEvil 
Intent Ido the Supreme Magical Force

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.980
The forest is angry.

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.890
It won't allow fighting to happen here.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.460
Sunlight Unicorn!

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:05.800
No.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.950
I won't let Sunlight Unicorn die.  I'll…

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:23.000
I know that your soul is currently 
in the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.940
I want you to tell me 
what kind of world it is.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.640
Do your best, Luca!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.860
Don't lose!

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.010
Luca!

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.960
Luca!  Do your best!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.140
Luca…

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.750
Luca…  Something's strange.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:55.010
When Horn of the Unicorn is sent to the 
graveyard, it returns to the top of the deck.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:59.260
Next, I activate the spell card 
Emergency Assistance from my hand.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.510
I can Special Summon one monster 
that was destroyed this turn.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.280
Sunlight Unicorn resurrects.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.390
What?  Sunlight Unicorn again?

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:19.130
Due to Sunlight Unicorn's monster effect,

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:23.930
if the top card in my deck is a 
spell card, I can add it to my hand.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.110
The top card in your deck is…

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:28.660
I equip Horn of the Unicorn.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:36.290
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.430
Sunlight Unicorn!

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:58.170
That's right.  Even if that monster 
is destroyed, it keeps resurrecting.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:05.370
Wait!

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.290
Kuribon…

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.740
Why is the forest destroyed?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:33.390
An evil being is trying to contaminate 
the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:38.340
It's trying to acquire 
the power of the spirits.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:41.130
An evil being?  Who is it?

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:55.960
That's…

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:01.940
Luca, I'm here.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.050
That voice is coming from 
that stone mountain.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.600
A dragon?

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:13.450
I know that dragon!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.880
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.490
Luca, we meet again.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.800
What's happening?

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.450
I'm done!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.210
Here you go.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:54.520
This is a really beautiful place.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:04.040
Why did the flowers wilt?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:12.040
Luca, it's due to an evil being that is 
coming near the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:21.080
The evil being will eventually come to 
this world to contaminate and control it.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:25.790
However, there's one thing that can stop it.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.360
Stop it?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.080
Luca, it's you.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.700
Me?

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:37.110
Your soul and this spirit 
world are connected.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:42.370
Your good soul will force back the evil soul.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.730
I want you to live with us in this world.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:50.400
I'm all alone.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.790
My father and mother are busy with work.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:58.350
And Lua only thinks about himself.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.270
This place is fun!

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:04.550
I'll stay here.  I'll protect you!

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.190
Luca…

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.520
That's right.  I remember now.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:32.670
Back then, I promised to protect 
this world.  However...

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:37.830
Luca.

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.290
Luca.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.840
What happened to them?

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:57.580
Luca…

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.550
Lua, what's wrong?

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.070
Lua, are you okay?

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.490
This is bad.  He's lost consciousness.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.610
Lua!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.340
Take him to the medical room!

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:11.380
Luca…

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.080
Luca…

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:17.330
But back then, I heard Lua's voice and…

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.900
Luca!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.220
Lua!

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:32.140
That's right.  I left you behind and fled.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:35.590
The reason why was because 
I heard Lua's voice.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.730
But in truth, I was scared.

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:43.940
I was afraid of protecting you all by myself.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:49.820
Then I tried to forget about you, so 
I sealed away this world in my heart.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:58.880
Luca!

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:05.050
Why is he also in that state?

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.140
That light...

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.990
There's a signal.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:27.940
Luca is definitely a Signer!

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:55.480
Lua!

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.500
Are you okay, Lua?

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.330
Lua…

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.300
It looks like they've lost consciousness.

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.510
My turn.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:16.820
I draw!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.840
What?

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.920
This is the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.450
You brought me here.

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:32.370
Like I thought, you're a Signer!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.700
Signer?

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.890
There's someone who wants your power.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:43.270
Now come with me to a world 
that will draw out your powers.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.340
Now…

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:45.750
Why?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.930
I don't have that kind of power!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:51.570
Why me?  Stop harassing me!

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:09.830
Why do I have to protect this world?

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.940
Why are people interested in my power?

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:16.660
Lua!  Call out to me, just like before!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.400
Take me back home!  Lua!

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.200
What's wrong, Lua?

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.540
Hang in there!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.330
Luca…

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.270
Luca…

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:35.670
Lua!  Lua!  I'm here!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:39.470
Please take me home!

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.310
Luca…

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:45.050
Where are you, Lua?

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.020
Luca…

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:59.330
Luca…

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.940
Lua!  Take me home!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.760
I can't.  I also saw you.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.230
You made a promise to everyone.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:09.910
Lua!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:13.660
I'll become strong like Yusei.

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:15.840
Luca…

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:22.000
Luca, I'll protect you.  So you 
have to protect that world.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.600
Lua…

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:46.590
I…

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.560
I…

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.250
Luca's eyes are back to normal.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.430
I will protect this world!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:02.280
I'll protect Kuribon and everyone else!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.750
I flip over my card!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.170
Pixie Ring!

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:31.660
When I have two or more monsters 
in attack position on my field,

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:36.760
you can't attack the monster 
with the fewest attack points!

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.780
I won't let you attack Kuribon anymore.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:46.860
Then from my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell Wave of Ill Intent!

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:56.930
Every time a monster on my field is 
destroyed in battle, you take 300 points of damage!

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:02.040
Ido the Supreme Magical Force 
attacks Sunlight Unicorn.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.400
Violent Egoism!

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.590
That hurt, young lady.

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:19.370
I'll make you also feel this pain.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.430
Wave of Ill Intent's effect activates!

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.150
I can withstand this…

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.050
How long will you be able to withstand it?

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:32.630
I activate the spell card 
Spirit Contamination!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.800
I can activate it on the turn 
in which a monster is destroyed.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:40.530
I can destroy one spell or 
trap card on your field!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.670
Kuribon's protection is gone.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.600
Ido the Supreme Magical Force 
resurrects at the End Phase.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:56.980
I end my turn!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:01.020
My turn.  I draw!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:09.480
Since Kuribon's attack points changed, 
you take Immortal Homeostasis's effect!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:11.900
300 points of damage!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:23.350
Even if I attack and destroy his 
monster, it will still lead to pain.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:24.600
What can I do?

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:28.530
I set one card.

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:33.190
Then from my hand, I activate 
the spell card Healing Wind!

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:38.970
For every monster on the field, 
I regain 200 life points!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.430
I end my turn!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:49.320
To tell you the truth, I 
don't care about your power.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:54.240
I'm fine with just defeating you.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:17:03.230
I'm fine as long as I can see 
you and the spirits in agony!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:13.200
This man is the evil being.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.460
I won't forgive him!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.060
Ido the Supreme Magical 
Force attacks Kuribon!

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.240
Feel agony, Kuribon!

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.110
Violent Egoism!

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:29.920
I won't let you!  I flip over 
my trap card Fairy Wind!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:37.840
All faceup spell and trap cards on the 
field, other than this card itself, are destroyed!

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.140
What?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:18:00.700
Both players take 400 points of damage for 
every card destroyed due to this card's effect.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:09.210
Since the Equip Spell is gone, Kuribon's 
attack points return to 300!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.870
Let's continue the battle!

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:14.790
Even if it's back to 300, what can you do?

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:18.250
Devour the spirits!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.300
Kuribon's monster effect.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.150
When Kuribon is attacked, 
I can return it to my hand.

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:27.370
Your monster deals no battle damage,

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:32.570
and you gain life points equal 
to the monster's attack points!

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:37.570
I won't let you touch Kuribon 
nor anyone else in this world!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:43.130
I will tarnish your world!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:04.720
Ancient Fairy Dragon is angry.

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:09.500
It's so angry at him that it doesn't 
know that it's hurting itself!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.150
At this rate, he's going to…

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.900
Please, Ancient Fairy Dragon!  
Let go of your anger!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.000
If I end this duel…

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:30.850
My set card Oberon's Prank!

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:34.630
This negates the effect that 
would have restored life points,

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:38.450
and both players take damage equal to the 
amount that would have been restored.

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:53.440
The evil being that sealed me was…

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.240
Is he OK?

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:11.810
Thank goodness.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.350
How's Lua?

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.190
Lua!  Thank goodness!

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.890
Where am I?

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.280
You fainted and collapsed.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.290
Really?  I thought I was dreaming.

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.860
What was I dreaming about?

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.360
You amaze me.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.180
Oh yeah.  How's Luca?

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.290
Look.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:54.740
The second chance battle ends incredibly 
with simultaneous destruction!

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.080
Both players lose.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:17.790
Don't worry.  I'll protect your world.

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:23.060
I'm fine.  I can walk by myself.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.580
Do what you want.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:29.040
Luca!

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.720
That child also has a mark.

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:09.230
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:14.620
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:20.550
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:25.780
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:28.940
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:34.530
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:41.690
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:47.090
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:53.030
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:58.370
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:04.440
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:13.850
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
